{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2017b-k2.q30.material.recovered", "text": "某教师在“抗日战争”的教学中，引用了一段日军第59师团第54旅团第110大队伍长富岛健司的口述材料：“我想起了1943年在渤海湾的沿海地带生活的事情。我们如果见了男人的话，就抓过来殴打，残酷地加以杀害。但是见了女人，就要羞辱她。如果她们哀求或反抗的话，就大骂她们‘混蛋，难道不知道为什么让你们活下来吗？’于是拼命地打她们，以致用刺刀将她们杀死。”然后，教师问：这段材料能说明什么？学生答道，说明日军侵华暴行。教师补充说：这是亲历者的口述，是日军暴行的有力证据。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "da26ad6da9e15afa4dc03a8254b24d15a842eab68222559433931f7ca44ed3d3", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2895, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3125, "next_source_question_number": 30, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 30, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "da26ad6da9e15afa4dc03a8254b24d15a842eab68222559433931f7ca44ed3d3"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2017b-k2.q30"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.s1.k04", "ntce.chuzhong.lishi.s1.k09", "ntce.chuzhong.lishi.s1.k10"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.310.r001", "ntce.outline.310.r002", "ntce.outline.316.r004"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2017b-k2.q30"], "word_count": 230, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "lishi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "da26ad6da9e15afa4dc03a8254b24d15a842eab68222559433931f7ca44ed3d3", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2895, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3125, "next_source_question_number": 30, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_ord